Kill vLLM and free memory in GPU

# See vLLM-related Python processes
ps -ef | grep -E "server\.py|EngineCore|vllm" | grep -v grep

# Nuclear option if you're confident no other workload is on the 3080:
pkill -9 -f "server.py"
pkill -9 -f "EngineCore"

# Verify GPU is empty again
nvidia-smi